### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@enrollmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@courseId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@lessonId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004

### 1. Enroll student in a course
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}"
}

### 2. Update lesson progress
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/{{enrollmentId}}/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lessonId": "{{lessonId}}"
}

### --- Edge cases ---

### 3. Enroll — corso inesistente (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "courseId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000999"
}

### 4. Enroll — studente già iscritto (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}"
}

### 5. Enroll — nessun pagamento completato (403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010",
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}"
}

### 6. Update progress — enrollment inesistente (404)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000999/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lessonId": "{{lessonId}}"
}

### 7. Update progress — UUID non valido (400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/not-a-valid-uuid/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lessonId": "{{lessonId}}"
}

### 8. Enroll — body non valido, UUID mancante (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "not-a-uuid",
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}"
}